<!--
  The notification's small icon.

  Android silhouettes small icons - every non-transparent pixel is repainted a
  flat colour - so the launcher mipmap this used to point at arrived as an
  indistinct grey blob. A small icon has to carry its meaning in its SHAPE
  alone, which is why this is a single white glyph on transparency.

  The mark is the training ring the whole app is built around, with the gap at
  the top that the session arc grows from.
-->
